WEBVTT

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.960
This is the end of our special program, Robotland.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.780
The island of robots' dreams.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.200
Robotland, the land of fairies.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:43.370
Oh, it's already this late. Atom, good night.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:44.190
Yes!

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:48.470
Dad, Mom, good night.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:49.510
Good night.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:52.320
Dad, are you ready for school tomorrow?

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.660
Not yet.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.340
We've just entered elementary school, so we'll study hard.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.640
I'm not good at studying.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:03.200
I'm not good at studying.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.340
If you say that, I can't catch up with Atom.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:21.790
If you say that, I can't catch up with Atom.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:22.030
Where is the textbook?

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.400
Atom, you can't go out this late.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.810
Atom, you can't go out this late.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:43.720
This is bad. I have to call the doctor.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.850
Well, what's the doctor's number?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.660
Oh, this swan is a robot!

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:51.840
What did you say?

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:19.310
Gatom, who are you?

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.540
Please help me.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.800
I'm not a monster. My name is Odette.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.220
I escaped from Robotland.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:29.600
Robotland?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:30.800
Um...

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.340
Robotland is a terrible place.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:34.100
Hm?

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:36.180
Oh!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:47.250
Miss Odette!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:51.000
Now, go back to Robotland!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:52.810
Y-You!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.520
No, um...

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:58.110
Now, Miss Odette, come with me.

00:03:58.450 --> 00:03:58.630
Yes!

00:03:59.560 --> 00:03:59.640
Hm?

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:00.950
What are you...

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.020
No, my name is...

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:04.910
Atom!

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.480
You are Atom.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.060
I'll show you what happens when you underestimate the Great Demon King, Satan-sama!

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.340
How was it? Did you get what you wanted?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:55.370
Tom, did you have a dream?

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.050
I don't have a dream about robots!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.740
Hmm, good.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.140
I haven't heard that something terrible is happening in Robotland.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:10.160
I'm sure Dr. Hyde is there.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:14.550
How about we go to Robotland and check it out?

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:15.530
Yes!

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:27.560
Atom, that's Robotland.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:36.190
By the way, Dr. Hyde and I used to be deskmates at the Faculty of Science, but...

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.770
About 20 years ago, he suddenly quit the Faculty of Science.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:44.370
But I never knew that he was working hard as an entrepreneur.

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.770
Hahaha, I can't wait to see him!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:52.380
Oh, tea water, I don't want to see you anymore!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.930
Thanks to him, I was always second!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.410
I've always had talent, but...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.720
By any chance, Ochanomizu, are you here to find out the secret of this island?

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:07.060
No, no, I don't think that person, Yoshi, would be so interested in it.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:26.900
Oh, wonderful! It really seems that you have come to the land of dreams, the world of fairies.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.680
Ochanomizu-kun, I've been waiting for you!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.600
Dr. Hyde, it's been a long time!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.590
This is Atom.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:37.930
Oh, you're the famous Atom.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.410
It's an honor to meet you.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:40.590
Hello.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.760
Well then, let me show you around.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:46.850
Dr. Hyde, what a great thing you've made.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.370
Yes, it was my lifelong dream.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.370
As a robot engineer, I...

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:52.850
Hmm?

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.770
I wanted to make a world of fairy tales and legendary countries

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:57.670
with robots on this island.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.970
I'm a person...

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.000
I wanted to create a world of dreams and fairytales that will be forgotten in the future.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.960
Oh, that's great. But it took a lot of money, didn't it?

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.730
With the special fee for my research.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:23.990
Who is the greatest robot scientist in the world?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:28.540
Of course it's you.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:29.510
You are the best in the world.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.940
My robot scientist is Dr. Hyde, and you are...

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.450
I see, I see.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.430
Mizu-kun, show me my robot factory.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:48.260
It's a freshly made monster.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:51.790
What do you think? It's a scary face, isn't it?

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.550
No, no, no, it's not enough!

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.830
Make it look more ugly, more disgusting!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.660
Like this...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.900
You can't do anything about it.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.410
I'm tired of it.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:03.420
It's too much!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.620
If it's made like this, everyone will...

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.580
Dr. Hyde, as Atom said,

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.290
you can't make the robots into toys without permission, can you?

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.190
Toys?

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:13.860
Do you think I'm binding the robots?

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.620
I'm not doing that.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.780
What do you think?

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:19.990
Do you have any complaints about this island?

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.220
I'm fine with it as it is.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.280
It's good for this job.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.680
Ochanomizu, you...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.280
That's right.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.110
Is this really him?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:35.310
Yes.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.700
Please tell me.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.430
This is Dr. Ochanomizu, the director of science.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.940
Please tell me who you are.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:49.300
I'm scared of someone.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.880
Ochanomizu, you're so rude.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.350
Take this rude robot and get out of here.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:58.210
Atom, there are still a lot of robots in the world.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.330
Robots from Robotland.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.540
It's all Dr. Hyde's property.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.890
If there's no evidence that he's really in trouble,

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.370
there's nothing we can do.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:19.310
It's a swan!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.010
It's Princess Odette!

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.760
If you ask me, I'll tell you the truth.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.910
Is it true that something terrible is happening in this Robot Land?

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.960
Tell me the truth.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.990
If you do that, everyone will be saved.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.440
You're in the way, Mizuko!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.500
What are you doing?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:58.360
Are you still trying to get me into trouble with my robot?

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.500
You're in the way.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.080
I'll sue the police!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.870
A-Atom...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.060
That's right!

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:07.740
Odette will return to human form at 12 o'clock!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.300
Please wait until then!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.920
I'll tell you the truth!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.410
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.540
Ochanomizu, hurry up and take that robot home!

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.580
I don't want to stay here for even a second!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.960
I'm going home, Atom!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:24.560
Dr. Ochanomizu!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:25.600
Please wait!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.860
Dr. Ochanomizu!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.030
I am King Siegfried.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.570
What Adam is saying is true.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:48.020
Great Demon King Satan!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.980
Take this!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.500
Atom, let's go!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:09.870
Atom, stop it! Dr. Hyde, stop that big thing!

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.910
Stop it, Satan!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:15.870
Stop it! It's him! The one who kidnapped Princess Dead last night!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.520
Hyde-kun, is it true what Atom is saying?

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.900
Oh, what are you talking about? I don't know.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.820
Then, what do you mean by attacking Prince Siegfried right now?

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:29.600
It's just an act. I don't care about anything.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.560
There's nothing to be angry about.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:32.960
You're the Minister of Science.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.820
You're not a grown-up.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:39.310
Let's go home.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.810
I'm not happy.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:56.440
All right.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:22.300
Thank you for watching.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.900
What's wrong, Atom?

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:04.990
Do you have no energy?

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:08.930
I'm taking the test!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:10.550
Ome-kun!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:10.890
Yes!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:12.220
Shibugaki-kun!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:12.420
Yes!

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:14.760
Atomu-kun! Atomu-kun!

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.740
Atomu, are you on vacation or sick?

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.230
Will a robot become sick?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.060
Isn't it being repaired?

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:22.360
Hahaha!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.200
Um, wait a minute.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.650
Everyone, concentrate!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:28.690
What?!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:29.830
Atomu is a robot...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.940
Did you attack Robotland?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.180
I was caught by Dr. Hyde for a bad thing.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.950
I got a call early this morning.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:44.260
It's your money that sent Atom to my island, Uchanomizu.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.600
What? Atom?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.420
I know.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:51.360
You don't like Robotland, so you sent Atom and made him rampage on purpose.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:52.660
No way.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.740
Come to Robotland right now and take responsibility.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.640
That's what I mean.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:58.700
I'm sorry.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:13:59.740
Anyway, go there.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.220
Let's go and see.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:00.960
Thank you.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:01.720
Let's go.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.980
The teacher's gone.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.240
The teacher's dirty.

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:08.660
He told everyone to self-study and go to Robot Land by himself.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.880
The teacher went to help Atomo.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.740
That's why I'm going to help too!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:14.420
Huh?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.680
That's unfair, Shibugaki!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.400
Keiichi, I'll go get him.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:18.000
No!

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:19.980
Shibugaki!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.020
What the hell are you trying to get me for?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.040
No, no.

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:24.980
Take me with you.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:26.310
Oh, okay.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:26.790
Let's go!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.360
I won't let you get away with it.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:32.870
Let's go together!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.350
Listen to me.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:37.710
Atom didn't come here to rampage.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.030
Atom is a good kid in class.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:41.890
There's no way he'd do that.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.090
What do you mean, a good kid?

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:45.370
You're making fun of such a violent robot!

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:47.680
Oh, oh!

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:48.860
If you don't listen to me,

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.460
you'll think I'm violent or making fun of it.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:51.700
Atom is not a dog!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.780
If you're a student, you're a student.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:54.900
If you're a teacher, you're a teacher.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.360
What the hell?!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.320
If you touch my finger,

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:58.600
I'll call the police!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.280
Dr. Hyde, what does Mr. Hygiene mean by that?

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:06.780
Dr. Ochanomizu, you are the director of the Ministry of Science, aren't you?

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.300
No, you are responsible for Atom.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.900
Even if it's a robot, you know what will happen if it enters other people's facilities without permission or breaks things, don't you?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:14.860
Yes, that's right.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:19.760
According to Article 136 of the Robot Law, the robot is scrapped.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:23.140
Also, the person responsible for it, that is, you, will also be charged with a crime.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:28.470
If I file a complaint, Atom will be punished, and you will be the head of the Ministry of Science.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.970
It's Robotland!

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.570
We'll be found if we go any closer!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.270
Leave it to me! I've got all the skin-diving tools I need!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:43.200
Dr. Hyde, I'm sorry.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.520
I'll do anything I can.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:49.820
Hmm, then I'll tell you.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.730
Destroy the Atom yourself!

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.320
Destroy the Atom?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.760
That's right.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.600
If you do that, I'll overlook your responsibility.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.820
In other words, you'll be the head of the Department of Science.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.000
I won't let you get away with this!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.300
No way!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.530
Come on, you idiot!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:19.560
It's the flower of truth!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:33.100
It looks like the worst cargo ship!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.640
Are they going to carry the ingredients of Robotland?

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.180
If that's the case, they should be carrying it to the venue.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.160
Let's take a look inside.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:52.100
They were making it secretly.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.300
Robotland's true identity is a total fraud!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.940
We made weapons for the robots, and sold them abroad with that submarine!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:11.100
Let's go!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:18.250
I'll show you!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.950
But you'll have to remodel it into a brick doll!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.240
Someone's trapped!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.240
Is it Gatom?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:24.460
No, it's not.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:25.670
Alright, let's go!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.880
Princess Odette is waiting!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.350
Who are you?

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:40.240
Hey, you!

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:49.630
Thank you. Who are you?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.080
We are Atom's classmates.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.500
Please take us to Atom.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.850
What's wrong, Mizu-kun?

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.970
Hurry up!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:00.350
Break his head.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.110
My head...

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:05.030
I can't do it. It's so cruel.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:06.840
It's just a robot.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:09.000
Why can't you shoot it?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.760
Mr. Hyde!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:11.820
Isn't this too much?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.500
What's too much?

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.720
If you break his head,

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.060
I'll forget everything this time.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:25.910
I can't do it.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:29.840
Dr. Hyde, I...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
I don't think I'm going to protect myself by doing that.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.610
Let's get dressed.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.690
I'll shoot you.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.380
Kazei, listen to me!

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:44.080
What are you guys doing?

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.560
Come on!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.960
Who would come here after skipping school?

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:54.250
Teacher, more importantly, we saw something terrible.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:54.970
What?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.870
This island is a weapon factory.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:02.390
The missiles and the laser guns have been stolen!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.270
What did you say?

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:05.150
Dr. Hyde!

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.670
Oh, did you see that?

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:14.070
I see. I thought I could do it if I didn't have a lot of money to make this Robotland,

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:18.670
but I was making weapons for the robots here and selling them to the gangs!

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:20.780
You're a double personality!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:21.790
That's right!

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:24.930
If this happens, everyone will die!

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.110
Shoai-san!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.360
I've been so frustrated that I've been patient.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.350
Sata!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:45.510
Hey, Sata!

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:46.920
Kill them all!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.520
Yes, sir!

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:56.730
Save Atom!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:00.480
You bastards!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.400
Satan, get him!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:12.220
Mr. Atom, here!

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:14.390
Thank you!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:21.320
Stop it!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:22.830
What?

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.100
You think you can beat me?

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.070
Let's go!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:54.990
I can't do this!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:32.410
Satan! My dear Satan!

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.520
What? What are you trying to do to me?

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.550
We are not slaves!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.110
We no longer accept your orders!

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.070
Robotland belongs to me!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:48.290
You are my slaves!

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:05.260
Robotland has become a very peaceful island.

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:07.660
Everyone is very excited.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:11.930
Atomu, please come and play with your family once.

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:16.050
Prince Siegfried and Princess Odette.

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:17.590
Let's go.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.000
We're going.

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:31.290
I'm making a robot with a high precision.

00:22:34.350 --> 00:22:36.360
Ah! The thunder has fallen!

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:38.070
Frankenstein, don't go wild!

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:40.180
You're still an unaccompanied robot!

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:43.240
I'm trying to use you for something bad!

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:46.360
Next time on Iron Atom!

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:47.310
Frankenstein!

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:48.510
Look forward to it!

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:11.340
Thank you for watching!

00:23:31.308 --> 00:23:33.308
Oh
